# bago, "before", the SUBTRACTIVE direction of the native clock: the count
# runs back from the UPCOMING ordinal-named hour ("labinlimang minuto bago
# ang ika-apat ng hapon" == 15:45).  The same source states that this is how
# Filipino tells a time past the half hour -- the additive native frame is
# not used there.  en.wiktionary.org, bago (preposition, "before"); en.wikipedia.org, "Date and time notation in the Philippines".
bago
